6","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Winterlich","x":"Our aggressive cost-reduction actions are starting to have an impact, which we've demonstrated by sequential margin improvement compared to the third quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/26/hexcel-corporation-hxl-q4-2020-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HXL 2021 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2021-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nick L. Stanage","x":"While we have a few more months of restructuring ahead of us, especially in Europe, which is on track, we are already realizing meaningful results from our rapid and robust response to the pandemic and its unprecedented effects on our business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/hexcel-corporation-hxl-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HXL 2021 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2021-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Winterlich","x":"We don't expect to generally be aligned with OEM production levels entering the second half of 2021, with destocking largely behind us and recognizing the beneficial impact of the cost takeout actions that we have implemented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/hexcel-corporation-hxl-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"HXL 2021 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2021-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nick L. Stanage","x":"The global pandemic required Hexcel to take aggressive and swift restructuring actions, which we did.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/hexcel-corp-hxl-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2021 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2021-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Patrick Winterlich","x":"The other expense category consisted primarily of restructuring costs in Europe.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/hexcel-corp-hxl-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2025 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2025-07-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tom 