ings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/hexcel-hxl-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2025 Q3","e":"hxl","d":"2025-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Gentile","x":"Our headcount has continued to decrease this year due to attrition and streamlining our operational footprint as well as lagging production schedules until we see clear evidence of increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/hexcel-hxl-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2025 Q4","e":"hxl","d":"2026-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Gentile","x":"In addition, we closed the facility in Belgium as we rationalized our footprint to streamline operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/hexcel-hxl-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2025 Q4","e":"hxl","d":"2026-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Gentile","x":"This included the business rationalization I mentioned earlier as we exited industrial markets like wind energy and winter recreation market, and we continue to streamline operations in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/hexcel-hxl-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2026-04-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Lenz","x":"Gross margin of 26.9% for 2026 increased from 22.4% in 2025 on volume, mix, and price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/hexcel-hxl-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas C. Gentile","x":"As part of our ongoing work to streamline Hexcel's portfolio toward markets that value our high-performance aerospace carbon fiber, we remain on track with the transition of our Leicester, UK business from industrial applications to aerospace development.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/hexcel-hxl-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2026-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas C. Gentile","x":"The restructuring cost from our transformation at Leicester impacted our results this quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/hexcel-hxl-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2026-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas C. Gentile","x":"On balance, we see the puts and takes for this year canceling each other out and we are maintaining our full-year guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/hexcel-hxl-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q1","e":"hxl","d":"2026-04-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Michael Lenz","x":"In closing, we had a solid first quarter, and as Thomas mentioned, we have reaffirmed our 2026 guidance including adjusted EPS of $2.10 to $2.30.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/23/hexcel-hxl-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"James Coogan","x":"Gross margin of 26.1% in the second quarter of 2026 increased from 22.8% in the second quarter of 2025 on improved operating leverage and price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/hexcel-hxl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thomas Gentile","x":"But when the other contracts come due, we are negotiating and we are seeing price increases in the renegotiation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/hexcel-hxl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas Gentile","x":"This sales decrease is primarily a result of lower industrial volume given the strategic actions we have taken over the past year to deemphasize this portion of our portfolio with the divestiture of our business in Austria and the restructuring of our industrial business in Western England.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/hexcel-hxl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q2","e":"hxl","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thomas Gentile","x":"We are raising guidance with an appropriate degree of balance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/hexcel-hxl-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q3","e":"hxl","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sales G. Coogan","x":"I am working very closely with our global team to improve price realization, while tightly managing our costs and continuous improvement efforts to expand our operating margins.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/hexcel-hxl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q3","e":"hxl","d":"2026-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sales G. Coogan","x":"Gross margin of 23.3% in the third quarter of 2020 increased from 21.9% in the third quarter of 2020 on improved operating leverage and price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/hexcel-hxl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"HXL 2026 Q3","e":"hxl","d":"2026-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas C. Gentile","x":"This is 1 example of how we are supporting new A&D entrants, and we streamline the process for evaluating, adopting our composite solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/22/hexcel-hxl-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,8442,0,0,0,6056,1809],[41,1,8125,0,0,0,6231,1421],[44,1,7708,0,0,0,6062,1100],[45,1,8003,0,0,0,5824,1632],[46,1,8662,0,0,0,6313,1815],[62,1,9076,0,0,0,7037,1592],[63,1,9042,0,0,0,7153,1555],[64,1,9128,0,0,0,7493,1324],[65,1,6377,0,0,0,5365,712],[66,1,8632,0,0,0,7292,1010],[67,1,9471,0,0,0,6810,19